# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Build context ignore rules (shared by all infra/docker/*.Dockerfile builds).
# Docker looks up `.dockerignore` next to the build context root; for these
# images the context is the repo root (see `docker build -f infra/docker/...`).
# Keep this in sync with the repo .gitignore.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Dependencies (reinstalled inside the image)
**/node_modules
.pnp
.pnp.*
.pnpm-store

# Build outputs (rebuilt inside the image)
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/out
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Turbo / test / coverage
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output

# Local env & secrets — never bake these into an image
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# VCS & tooling
.git
.gitignore
.github
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/*.swp
.DS_Store

# Infra & docs not needed at build time
infra/terraform
infra/k8s
docs

# Flutter / mobile (not part of server images)
apps/mobile

# Logs & temp
**/*.log
logs
tmp
uploads
